  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Check test-bot dependencies recursively by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23981\r\n* Gemfiles: require a minimum Ruby version by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23983\r\n* sandbox: pass the terminal to stty by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23994\r\n* install: separate upgrades in dry-run summaries by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23986\r\n* Document VS Code Ruby LSP setup by @HaraldNordgren in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23995\r\n* shell: write a literal line into a PowerShell profile by @rawsun007 in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23996\r\n* Allow sandboxed icon conversion on macOS by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23999\r\n* formula: run Java headless in sandboxed phases by @ashr123 in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24001\r\n* Share Git facts across platform views and load legacy formulae in history walks by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23990\r\n* Hold prerelease-ambiguous versions in advisory matching by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23991\r\n* Add brew advisory-match --reconcile-history by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23992\r\n* Harden ownership and permissions of cask apps by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24003\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @ashr123 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24001\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/compare/7.0.2...7.0.3",
